        {
            "spellKey": "q",
            "name": "恩屠浮强击",
            "abilityIconPath": "/lol-game-data/assets/ASSETS/Characters/KSante/HUD/Icons2D/Icons_KSante_Q1.png",
            "abilityVideoPath": "champion-abilities/0897/ability_0897_Q1.webm",
            "abilityVideoImagePath": "champion-abilities/0897/ability_0897_Q1.jpg",
            "cost": "@Cost@ @AbilityResourceName@",
            "cooldown": "@f1.2@ 秒",
            "description": "将武器向前猛击，对短距离直线上的敌人造成伤害与缓速。<br><br>命中时，提供 1 层叠层，持续数秒。叠至 2 层时，此技能打出一道冲击波将敌人往回拉曳。",
            "dynamicDescription": "卡桑帝将武器朝地面猛击，造成<physicalDamage>@BaseDamage@物理伤害</physicalDamage>，并使命中的敌人短暂<status>减速</status>@SlowPercent*100@%。<br><br>此技能命中一名敌人时，卡桑帝也会获得1层恩屠浮强击效果，持续@RecastWindow@秒。叠至2层时，卡桑帝将改为射出一道冲击波，<status>晕眩</status>并<status>拉拽</status>敌人，持续@StunDuration@秒。<br><br><rules>冷却时间缩减受到额外<scaleArmor>物理防御</scaleArmor>和<scaleMR>魔法防御</scaleMR>的影响：@BonusResistsTooltip@/@DefenseCapforCooldown@。<br>施法时间缩短受到额外<healing>生命值</healing>的影响：@BonusHealthTooltip@/@HealthCapForCastTime@。</rules><br><br><keywordMajor>拼死一搏</keywordMajor>：此技能的冷却时间会缩短，但不再<status>减慢</status>。 @SpellModifierDescriptionAppend@",
